<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in Italian first</p>
<p>division after matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>4 - Marcello Otero (Vicenza)</p>
<p>3 - Abel Balbo (Roma), Felippo Inzaghi (Atalanta), Marco Simone</p>
<p>and George Weah (both Milan)</p>
<p>2 - Nicola Caccia (Napoli), Enrico Chiesa and Gianfranco Zola</p>
<p>(both Parma), Daniel Fonseca (Roma), Igor Kolyvanov (Bologna),</p>
<p>Roberto Mancini and Vincenzo Montella (both Sampdoria), Marco</p>
<p>Negri (Perugia), Luis Oliveira and Gabriel Batistuta (both</p>
<p>Fiorentina), Sandro Tovalieri (Reggiana)</p>
</text>
